  "observations": [
    "Owned Escape listener runs after the global handler, which returns without stopPropagation while UI.choose canDismiss is false. Abort reason identity distinguishes intentional cancellation from replacement/recovery.",
    "SourceActionRecovery gates reentrancy and save until the chosen target and HUD refresh complete; cancellation returns the original party reference and all callbacks/listeners are cleaned.",
    "Battle Tower partner exclusion equals the literal native map predicate in frontier_field_support.c. Native Elm reward queries first living member, so ordinary field order enables the source script without alternate quest gating.",
    "Follower reference+species tracking handles distinct same-species slots and no lead. Current allocator creates unique texture/geometry/material resources; removePaper releases captured owned resources only and is idempotent, retaining source/shared attachments.",
    "Recovery rebuilds state records and restores follower tracking consistently. Pending hatch guard still delays follower change until source checkpoint releases."
  ],
